   "text": "Thanks, Victor, you're verified. I've reviewed order Q-7801 from Taqueria Luz.\n\nYour order was promised for 6:15 PM and handed over at 6:45 PM, so it was 30 minutes late. That qualifies for account credit equal to the delivery fee, which is $2.99.\n\nAn earlier support contact tonight (at 7:05 PM) already gave you that $2.99 credit, and it's on your account now. I can't compensate the same problem twice, so there's nothing more I can add for the lateness.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with, such as a missing or wrong item in the order?"
